        "@value": true
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@value": "If a masonry wall has a vulnerability that is ‘inadequate out of plane behaviour’, then it has an occurring mechanism that is ‘out of plane failure’."
      }
    ],
